We do the basic grain initiation and their growth with a primitive rule of any neighbour being solid. No extra physics have been incorporated yet. However, the rules would primarily be similar to what we formulated for 2d CA. 

The library of pyvista is still nnot fully learned throughout and hence a lot of improvements - syntax / computational, can be made in the code. This version was made with refernences and help found as is, on the internet. 
